---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const serviceSchema = {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Service", "name": "BOLT lithium golf cart batteries for Ocala owners", "serviceType": "Golf cart lithium battery replacement and lead-acid-to-lithium conversion", "url": "https://golfcartrentalocala.com/lithium-golf-cart-batteries-ocala/", "provider": {"@type": "LocalBusiness", "name": "Masters Golf Cars", "address": {"@type": "PostalAddress", "streetAddress": "12885 S US Hwy 441", "addressLocality": "Belleview", "addressRegion": "FL", "postalCode": "34420", "addressCountry": "US"}}};
---
<Layout title="Lithium Golf Cart Battery Replacement in Ocala | BOLT" description="BOLT lithium golf cart battery replacement and lead-acid conversion for Ocala owners. Belleview workshop service with pickup and delivery available.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceSchema)} />
  <article class="battery-service">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">BOLT lithium battery service</p><h1>BOLT lithium golf cart batteries for Ocala owners</h1><p class="intro">Own an electric golf cart in Ocala? Arrange BOLT lithium battery replacement or a lead-acid-to-lithium conversion through our team. Installation service takes place at the Masters Golf Cars shop in Belleview, and pickup and delivery are available.</p><a class="call" href="tel:+13527801526">Call (352) 780-1526 for a quote</a></header>
    <div class="service-content"><section><h2>Keep the cart you own, update its battery setup</h2><p>You do not need to be renting a cart to ask about battery service. We help owners arrange replacement of an existing lithium battery or conversion from lead-acid. Start with your cart make, model, year, and a description of its current batteries.</p></section>
<section><h2>Tell us what has changed</h2><p>If your cart is running for less time, struggling to charge, or no longer meeting your needs, describe the symptoms when you call. A battery replacement may be one part of the solution; ask about the cart assessment before choosing a new battery.</p></section>
<section><h2>Arrange pickup from Ocala or bring your cart to Belleview</h2><p>Workshop service is at 12885 S US Hwy 441, Belleview, FL 34420. If transporting your cart is difficult, ask about pickup and delivery for your address. Confirm the transport cost and available dates as part of your service quote.</p></section>
<section><h2>What to ask when comparing conversion quotes</h2><p>Ask which BOLT battery is proposed for your cart, whether charger changes or other components are needed, and what labor is included. Compare the full installed price and any pickup/delivery charges. Request the applicable battery warranty and service terms in writing before approving the work.</p></section>
      <section class="next-step"><h2>Ready to discuss your cart?</h2><p>Call (352) 780-1526 with your cart details and preferred service dates. Confirm battery selection, installed pricing, pickup and delivery, and warranty terms before booking.</p><nav aria-label="Battery service next steps"><a href="/golf-cart-repairs-ocala/">General repairs and maintenance</a><a href="/contact/">Contact our Ocala team</a><a href="/rentals/">Explore Ocala golf cart rentals</a></nav></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
<style>
.battery-service { color:#172b24; background:#fff; }
.battery-service header { background:#edf5ef; padding:4rem max(1.25rem,calc((100% - 1080px)/2)); }
.eyebrow { color:#245638; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; font-size:.85rem; }
h1 { font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem); line-height:1.12; font-weight:800; max-width:950px; margin:1rem 0 1.5rem; }
p { line-height:1.8; font-size:1.1rem; }
.intro { max-width:850px; }
.call { display:inline-block; background:#185936; color:white; padding:1rem 1.4rem; border-radius:.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem; font-weight:700; }
.service-content { max-width:1080px; padding:1rem 1.25rem 4rem; margin:auto; }
section { margin-top:2.75rem; max-width:900px; }
h2 { font-size:1.7rem; line-height:1.3; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:1rem; }
.next-step { background:#f2f6f3; padding:1.5rem; border-radius:.75rem; }
nav { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem 2rem; margin-top:1rem; }
nav a { color:#185936; text-decoration:underline; font-weight:700; }
a:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #b17d11; outline-offset:4px; }

.battery-service header{background:#f7f5ef;border-bottom:1px solid #d5dfd6;padding-top:4.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem}
